$grp PS_MissionDescription : "{3136BE42592F3B1B}PrefabsEditable/MissionDescription/EditableMissionDescription.et" {
 A_Situation_US {
  coords 4195.181 429.886 6348.679
  m_sTitle "I. Situation"
  m_sTextData "DTL: 15/10/2005, 1100hr, Chernarus."\
  ""\
  "For the past week US and Chernarussian government forces have been conducting a combined offensive against the Russian backed separatist group known as the “Chernarussian Movement of the Red Star” or ChDKZ. As part of this offensive our stryker mechanized infantry platoon has been tasked with assaulting the separatist held dilapidated town of Hamertin, which is located along an important road junction. Due to the rapid pace of the ongoing offensive only limited preliminary reconnaissance has been conducted. We have an accurate idea as to the total strength and equipment of hostile forces, but little to no knowledge of their exact location in the AO beyond the assumption that they will be concentrated in and around Hamertin itself due to its abundant cover and concealment."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "US"
  }
 }
 B_Mission_US {
  coords 4196.476 429.915 6331.949
  m_sTitle "II. Mission"
  m_sTextData "We are to assault and occupy the town of Hamertin, securing it and its vital road junction for follow on forces. It is not required that we eliminate all separatist forces in the AO, but Hamertin and its immediate surroundings must be cleared. We must achieve this objective within 50 minutes, this is in order to maintain the rapid pace of the ongoing offensive which has so far prevented any substantial regrouping of separatist forces."\
  "Should we succeed in occupying Hamertin we should then prevent as much as possible the retreat of local separatist forces westwards, most importantly their BMP-1P. Regardless of if separatists forces successfully retreat we will still achieve victory if Hamertin has been captured on time."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "US"
  }
  m_iOrder 1
 }
 C_FriendForce_US {
  coords 4196.788 429.996 6332.346
  m_sTitle "III. Friendly Forces"
  m_sTextData "Our Stryker mechanized infantry platoon is the only friendly force in the AO. Our platoon consists of 1x platoon HQ, 2x rifle squads, and 1x weapons squad. We are equiped with 3x Stryker APCs armed with M2 CROWS, and 1x uparmored Humvee armed with M2."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "US"
  }
  m_iOrder 2
 }
 D_EnemyForce_US {
  coords 4201.158 430.771 6328.127
  m_sTitle "IV. Enemy Forces"
  m_sTextData "Roughly 3x platoons worth of irregular infantry, dispersed throughout the AO but expected to be primarily concentrated around Hamertin itself. Multiple PKM and NSV fighting positions. 1x BMP-1P (Konkurs ATGM). Multiple light vehicles for the transportation of troops and supplies. "\
  "Separatist forces are equipped with Soviet and Russian small arms, and wear a wide variety of uniform patterns and camouflage. They have little if any PPE such as helmets and body armor."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "US"
  }
  m_iOrder 3
 }
}